{
 "title": "My Esoteric Healer | Quantum Healing Hypnosis in Canungra | Transform Your Life",
 "metaDesc": "Discover My Esoteric Healer  transformative healing with Marina, a certified hypnotherapist trained in Dolores Cannon's Quantum Healing Hypnotherapy technique. Based in the serene Hinterland, Canungra, Marina provides tailored sessions to unlock the subconscious, explore past lives, and resolve inner conflicts. Fluent in Greek, she offers a safe, personalized space for growth and healing.",
