  {
   "tag": "h1",
   "text": "Is QHHT Safe? Discover the Benefits of Quantum Healing Hypnosis?",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lp33"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Quantum Healing Hypnosis Technique is a hypnosis method developed by the late Dolores Cannon over her 40+year career course. It takes the person into the deepest level of trance to enable past life regression and healing through contact with the “Higher Self” or “Subconscious”. This part of the self is loving and ready to share insights into why we are experiencing the things we are in this lifetime and help us cope with pain, stress, and traumas. Many wonder, is QHHT safe? With myesoterichealer, you can rest assured that safety and personalised care are paramount. Located in the serene Hinterland, Canungra, we offer a tranquil environment for your transformative journey.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lp33"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "​",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lp33"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Your Session with Marina",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "A Quantum Healing Hypnosis session may take around five hours.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The aim is to clear and heal your main concerns in one session. The day is broken up into three parts: Interview, Hypnosis, and Debrief. Your Higher Self will guide us to where we need to go to get the answers you seek.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "INTERVIEW",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "1 to 2 Hours",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "​We will discuss your main concerns and in depth during this time. Getting to know you is significant so that I can ask relevant questions whilst you’re under hypnosis.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "HYPNOSIS",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "1 to 2 Hours",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "​",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "We will ‘travel’ into an alternate time. This could be earlier in this current life, a past life, or even a future life. We will then contact your Higher Self or Subconscious Mind to ask questions and receive healing.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "DEBRIEF",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "1 Hour",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "You may or may not remember any of the session, so we will take some time to discuss what happened and let you adjust to your normal waking state before going on about the rest of your day.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "YOUR QUESTIONS",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "​",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What you want to know will direct where we go in your session. My job is to have relevant answers and guidance for you once you awaken, so we need to use the time wisely. I’d like you to bring along to your session a list of questions. These can be serious, relevant questions you’re desperate to get answers to, but you can also include some ‘curiosity’ questions.  Don’t limit yourself. Ask what’s in your heart. We’ll discuss these questions in our session.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "RECORDING",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "​The hypnosis part of our session will be recorded on my laptop device and provided to you at the conclusion of our session. Alternatively, you can always record the session on your mobile device. It is suggested that you listen to this regularly as the healing and insights will continue to integrate after the session. I advise against listening to this while you’re driving as you can enter a Theta state.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "CONCLUSION OF SESSION",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "As we wrap up our session, take a moment to enjoy the calm and clarity you’ve gained, knowing that the positive changes will continue to resonate and support you in your journey ahead. Please take some time to reflect on your experience and any new insights you’ve gained. Over the next few days, you might notice continued changes, so be sure to practice self-care. Remember, the positive effects of today’s session will continue to develop.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqz2"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "text": "About me",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqh"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "At MyEsotericHealer.com, Marina is a certified hypnotherapist under the teachings of the late Dolores Cannon with a few years of experience, which focuses on Quantum Healing Hypnotherapy technique in order to create a personalized experience for each client. Marina's approach is tailored to each individual, creating a safe space for exploration and healing.\nHaving experienced the transformative power of hypnotherapy myself, I’m passionate about helping others achieve similar positive changes by unlocking the subconscious, revealing past life memories, resolving inner conflicts, and fostering deep personal growth.\nMy rooms are in the beautiful countryside of Hinterland, Canungra and are more than happy to travel within 20 kilometres radius to your own safe space, given you have a quiet room that can be darkened and uninterrupted for at least two hours. I am also fluent in Greek and can conduct sessions effectively fully in Greek language. Do not hesitate to reach out to me to see how Quantum Healing Hypnotherapy can help you reach your goals.",
   "section": "comp-m04z7lqh"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "text": "My Esoteric Healer",
   "section": "comp-m04z7ln9"
